        "TileImage": "$($repository 2f647ee4-f1f7-4a37-919f-edbb9631820d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Five conspirators in Marrakesh have orchestrated the sale of stolen military weapons to terrorist organizations. A rug merchant launders their profits, a janitor destroys evidence, a guard protects their operation, and two military specialists oversee distribution. Our client demands a personal touch. No firearms, no distant accidents. Each target must know their reckoning has arrived. Five targets, five personal encounters. Good hunting, 47.",
